1
00:00:01,213 --> 00:00:02,933
Let's see who dares kick me out

2
00:00:03,347 --> 00:00:05,227
I'm carrying a Jiang heir

3
00:00:07,880 --> 00:00:09,040
He's your grandson

4
00:00:10,280 --> 00:00:12,500
Could you bear to see him out on the streets?

5
00:00:13,213 --> 00:00:14,280
Stop acting, you old hag

6
00:00:14,280 --> 00:00:15,080
At your age

7
00:00:15,080 --> 00:00:16,413
how could you possibly get pregnant?

8
00:00:16,413 --> 00:00:17,213
We're at a hospital

9
00:00:17,213 --> 00:00:18,693
How could I lie?

10
00:00:20,147 --> 00:00:21,480
Son, I'm begging you

11
00:00:21,480 --> 00:00:23,120
I'm already ruined

12
00:00:23,347 --> 00:00:24,947
The Jiang family's only heir

13
00:00:24,947 --> 00:00:25,707
Get up

14
00:00:26,280 --> 00:00:27,880
I exposed my husband's affair with the maid

15
00:00:27,880 --> 00:00:28,947
and was killed for it

16
00:00:28,947 --> 00:00:29,387
This life

17
00:00:30,280 --> 00:00:32,400
your whole family will pay in blood

18
00:00:33,747 --> 00:00:34,547
Xiaolan, come

19
00:00:34,547 --> 00:00:35,787
Come wash my feet

20
00:00:37,480 --> 00:00:39,347
Zhang Guifen, don't push it

21
00:00:39,347 --> 00:00:40,413
Oh my

22
00:00:40,413 --> 00:00:42,013
My precious son says

23
00:00:42,013 --> 00:00:44,147
he wants Grandma serving him personally

24
00:00:44,147 --> 00:00:45,213
If she doesn't serve well

25
00:00:45,213 --> 00:00:46,547
he won't come out

26
00:00:46,547 --> 00:00:47,613
He'll stay in there

27
00:00:47,613 --> 00:00:49,493
Let's see who panics

28
00:00:51,880 --> 00:00:53,213
You little darling

29
00:00:53,213 --> 00:00:54,533
Honey

30
00:00:54,547 --> 00:00:56,267
Honey, calm down

31
00:00:56,413 --> 00:00:58,280
Careful of the baby in her belly

32
00:00:58,280 --> 00:00:59,347
If not for that belly

33
00:00:59,347 --> 00:01:00,947
carrying a Jiang heir

34
00:01:00,947 --> 00:01:03,827
I'd have thrown you out long ago

35
00:01:09,480 --> 00:01:10,290
Don't hurt the baby

36
00:01:12,147 --> 00:01:13,227
Something's wrong

37
00:01:13,480 --> 00:01:15,080
That look in Jiang Chengang's eyes

38
00:01:15,080 --> 00:01:16,890
It's not how you look at a daughter-in-law

39
00:01:21,213 --> 00:01:21,963
Oh, Chengang

40
00:01:22,013 --> 00:01:22,733
Gently

41
00:01:23,347 --> 00:01:24,680
I'm carrying your child

42
00:01:24,680 --> 00:01:25,920
Don't crush him

